### Suggested Technology

Use an appropriate modern full-stack architecture.

Suggested stack:
- Frontend: React / Next.js.
- Styling: Tailwind CSS.
- Backend: Supabase or an equivalent secure backend.
- Database: PostgreSQL.
- Authentication: Supabase Auth or equivalent.
- File storage: Secure cloud storage.
- Email: Transactional email service.
- Hosting: Vercel or equivalent.

Choose the most suitable architecture supported by the development platform.

